# GEN ERA Environment Configuration

## Frontend Environment Variables

### API Configuration
```
NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL=http://localhost:3001
```

### Supabase Integration
```
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=your-supabase-url
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=your-supabase-anon-key
SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY=your-service-role-key
```

### OpenAI Configuration
```
NEXT_PUBLIC_OPENAI_API_KEY=your-openai-api-key
OPENAI_API_KEY=your-openai-api-key
NEXT_PUBLIC_OPENAI_MODEL=gpt-4-turbo-preview
```

### Analytics & Monitoring
```
NEXT_PUBLIC_SENTRY_DSN=your-sentry-dsn
SENTRY_AUTH_TOKEN=your-sentry-auth-token
NEXT_PUBLIC_POSTHOG_KEY=your-posthog-key
NEXT_PUBLIC_POSTHOG_HOST=https://app.posthog.com
```

### Vercel Deployment
```
VERCEL_ORG_ID=your-vercel-org-id
VERCEL_PROJECT_ID=your-vercel-project-id
VERCEL_TOKEN=your-vercel-token
VERCEL_SCOPE=your-vercel-scope
```

### 3D & Media
```
NEXT_PUBLIC_3D_ASSET_URL=/models
NEXT_PUBLIC_IMAGE_CDN_URL=https://cdn.genera.app
NEXT_PUBLIC_ENABLE_WEBGL_DEBUG=false
```

## Backend Environment Variables

### Database
```
MONGODB_URI=mongodb://localhost:27017/gen-era
```

### Authentication
```
JWT_SECRET=your-secret-key
JWT_EXPIRE=7d
REFRESH_TOKEN_SECRET=your-refresh-secret
REFRESH_TOKEN_EXPIRE=30d
```

### API Configuration
```
PORT=3001
NODE_ENV=production
LOG_LEVEL=info
API_RATE_LIMIT=100
```

### Payment Integration
```
STRIPE_SECRET_KEY=your-stripe-secret
STRIPE_WEBHOOK_SECRET=your-stripe-webhook-secret
PAYMOB_API_KEY=your-paymob-api-key
PAYMOB_MERCHANT_ID=your-merchant-id
```

### Email Service
```
RESEND_API_KEY=your-resend-api-key
SENDER_EMAIL=noreply@genera.app
```

### Observability
```
SENTRY_DSN=your-sentry-dsn
PINO_LOG_LEVEL=info
```

## Setup Instructions

### 1. Frontend Setup
```bash
cp .env.example .env.local
# Edit .env.local with your configuration
```

### 2. Backend Setup
```bash
cd backend
cp .env.example .env
# Edit .env with your configuration
```

### 3. GitHub Secrets (CI/CD)
Add these secrets to your GitHub repository:
- `NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL`
- `NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL`
- `NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY`
- `NEXT_PUBLIC_OPENAI_API_KEY`
- `NEXT_PUBLIC_SENTRY_DSN`
- `NEXT_PUBLIC_POSTHOG_KEY`
- `VERCEL_ORG_ID`
- `VERCEL_PROJECT_ID`
- `VERCEL_TOKEN`
- `VERCEL_SCOPE`

### 4. Local Development
```bash
# Install dependencies
npm install

# Setup git hooks
npm run prepare

# Start development
npm run dev
npm run backend

# In another terminal, seed database
npm run backend:seed
```
